<view class="container leaderboard-page">
  <view class="page-head lb-head">
    <view>
      <text class="page-head__eyebrow">LEADERBOARD</text>
      <view class="page-head__title">排行榜</view>
      <text wx:if="{{summary}}" class="muted">{{summary}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="lb-window">
      <text class="lb-window__label">赛季</text>
      <picker
        mode="selector"
        range="{{windows}}"
        range-key="label"
        value="{{windowIndex}}"
        bindchange="onWindowChange"
      >
        <view class="lb-window__select">{{windows[windowIndex].label}} ▾</view>
      </picker>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="lb-tabs">
    <view
      wx:for="{{boards}}"
      wx:key="key"
      class="lb-tab {{boardKey === item.key ? 'lb-tab--active' : ''}}"
      data-key="{{item.key}}"
      bindtap="onBoardChange"
    >{{item.label}}</view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="state">
    <van-loading size="20px">加载中…</van-loading>
  </view>

  <view wx:elif="{{error}}" class="state">
    <text class="muted">{{error}}</text>
    <view class="btn btn--primary btn--small" bindtap="retry" hover-class="btn--pressed">重试</view>
  </view>

  <van-empty wx:elif="{{rows.length === 0}}" description="当前窗口暂无符合条件的球员" />

  <view wx:else class="lb-board">
    <view class="lb-board-head lb-grid">
      <text class="lb-head-rank" aria-hidden="true"></text>
      <text class="lb-head-player">球员</text>
      <text class="lb-head-stat lb-head-stat--current">{{mainLabel}}</text>
      <text class="lb-head-stat">历史累计</text>
      <text class="lb-head-stat">生涯累计</text>
    </view>

    <view class="lb-list">
      <view class="lb-row lb-grid" wx:for="{{rows}}" wx:key="playerId">
        <text
          class="lb-rank {{index === 0 ? 'lb-rank--top' : ''}}"
          aria-label="名次 {{item.rank}}"
        >{{item.rank}}</text>

        <view class="lb-player">
          <image
            wx:if="{{item.avatarUrl}}"
            class="lb-avatar"
            src="{{item.avatarUrl}}"
            mode="aspectFill"
            aria-hidden="true"
            data-id="{{item.playerId}}"
            binderror="onAvatarError"
          />
          <text wx:else class="lb-avatar lb-avatar--fallback" aria-hidden="true">{{item.initial}}</text>
          <text class="lb-name" aria-label="球员 {{item.name}}">{{item.name}}</text>
        </view>

        <text
          class="lb-stat lb-stat--current {{item.currentZero ? 'lb-stat--zero' : ''}}"
          aria-label="{{mainLabel}} {{item.currentText}}"
        >{{item.currentText}}</text>
        <text
          class="lb-stat lb-stat--history {{item.historyZero ? 'lb-stat--zero' : ''}}"
          aria-label="历史累计 {{item.historyText}}"
        >{{item.historyText}}</text>
        <text
          class="lb-stat lb-stat--career {{item.careerZero ? 'lb-stat--zero' : ''}}"
          aria-label="生涯累计 {{item.careerText}}"
        >{{item.careerText}}</text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="lb-note">
    <text class="lb-note-title">注:</text>
    <text class="lb-note-body">出场含临时到场、不含缺勤与取消比赛；乌龙单列且不抵进球。胜率只统计队内赛，且仅统计有分组归属的场次；并列采用标准竞赛排名（1、1、3）。</text>
    <text class="lb-note-body">生涯累计汇总当前赛季与历史累计（不晚于当前自然年，未来赛季不计），历史累计只汇总早于当前年份的赛季（不含当前赛季）；两者固定不随所选赛季与榜单变化。</text>
  </view>
</view>
